  "applies_to": "Siemens QFM9150/MO duct humidity/temperature sensor and QPM9152/MO duct air quality (CO2, VOC, humidity, temperature) sensor, basic documentation edition a (2022-12).",
  "summary": "These Siemens duct sensors talk Modbus RTU over RS-485 and share one holding-register map. The QFM9150/MO measures temperature and relative humidity; the QPM9152/MO adds CO2, an IAQ index and a VOC value. Each reading has a reliability register next to it. The map covers all published measurement, offset, unit, communication and version registers.",
